  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KAWUO - Women Empowerment, Action and Voice in Karamoja (WEAV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A more inclusive governance system in Karamoja, that ensures equitable representation, and responsiveness in decision-making. This will be realised through three related outcomes: 1) increased participation and influence of women in decision-making processes, 2) enhanced responsiveness of local government and cultural leaders to women&#x2019;s needs and 3) improved community attitudes and support for gender equality and women&#x2019;s participation in decision making.</narrative>
  </description>
